    - rid: 7865912988557640580
      type: {class: StickyNoteModel, ns: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework, asm: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework}
      data:
        Position: {x: -519.3947, y: 63.374428}
        ID:
          m_Value0: 8740306803522823991
          m_Value1: 11649287898953131828
        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: 'If you wish to have a Start Of Combat Ability, assign it

          here. Otherwise, ensure that the "Start of Combat

          Ability" is set to "EmptyEnemyAbility", as there is no

          easy way to check for "null" instead.


          If a Start of Combat Ability is present, it will run, then

          proceed to the main loop. Otherwise, the graph will wait

          "Start of Combat Delay" seconds before entering the

          main loop.'
    - rid: 7865913005688226767
      type: {class: StickyNoteModel, ns: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework, asm: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework}
      data:
        Position: {x: 370.93964, y: 424.70142}
        ID:
          m_Value0: 1014135800726242902
          m_Value1: 17481646120402359005
        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: 'Specifies an amount of seconds to wait in between each attack. Typically useful

          to have at least a 1 second of a cooldown to allow the Ability charge prompt to

          properly debuild when using an ability that has a warning and attack duration

          of 0. (Such as during a SummonBackup ability)'
    - rid: 7865913068295553744
      type: {class: StickyNoteModel, ns: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework, asm: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework}
      data:
        Position: {x: 300.77106, y: 344.57535}
        ID:
          m_Value0: 8032404654532283277
          m_Value1: 6875604549737337589
        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: 'A crutial node to the graph. When the graph flows through to the end,

          it will return here and attempt to repeat any logic contained below.

          This is what allows the enemy to endlessly attack.'
    - rid: 7865913070587216093
      type: {class: StickyNoteModel, ns: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework, asm: Unity.Behavior.GraphFramework}
      data:
        Position: {x: 297.21613, y: -111.06514}
        ID:
          m_Value0: 9397872135839728003
          m_Value1: 6808918883481279534
        Parents: []
        PortModels: []
        Text: 'We want to make sure "Repeat" is turned off here. Otherwise, our

          StartOfCombat Abilities would loop repeatedly. We want the enemy to

          continue attacking due to a "Repeat" node further down the graph.'
    - rid: 7865913073264492794
      type: {class: BehaviorGraphNodeModel/FieldModel, ns: Unity.Behavior, asm: Unity.Behavior.Authoring}
